{
  "name": "dsh-skill-browser",
  "version": "2.2.5",
  "description": "技能浏览器：悬浮球打开面板，把本机技能库变成可浏览、可检索、可治理的资产——五个 Tab（技能浏览/调用台账/MCP 管理/市场/快速上手）、树状/平铺双视图、手动+关键词+AI 三种分组（分组只改视图不动技能文件）、调用台账看板（调用次数/成功率/趋势图/技能调用排行）、130 款三球同步皮肤（6 列宽屏菜单）、9 步快速上手、MCP 管理（读取运行时 MCP 配置、真实连接状态、工具清单与自动功能概括、调用统计落盘、启停即时跟随/重连/卸载/导出标准 mcpServers JSON、重绘不跳顶且面板记忆上次滚动位置、卡片每行列数技能 3~6 / MCP 3~5）、DSH 设置页悬浮球导航分区；一键热重载，技能库位置可配置，悬浮球可拖拽可复位、市场（MCP 市场：官方 Registry + 29 条精选免费目录、19 大类平铺分类带每类数量、网格/列表双模式、卡片逐字复刻技能卡、每条 MCP 用其自身真实图标并自动降级、一键安装写入 cordis.patch.yml 并自动备份、一键卸载、仅免费筛选、24 小时磁盘缓存、与 MCP 页双向即时同步）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "sideEffects": false,
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1",
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.json",
    "lib/**/*.ps1",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "lib/orb/*.html",
    "docs/images/**",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README-zh.md",
    "README-es.md",
    "README-pt.md",
    "README-hi.md",
    "scripts",
    "screenshots.json"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "skill",
    "技能",
    "skills-browser",
    "skill-browser",
    "fluent",
    "cfd",
    "分类",
    "category",
    "chinese",
    "中文简介"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "^0.1.7-rc.1 || ^0.2.0-rc.1"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-skill-browser.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-skill-browser#readme",
  "packageManager": "pnpm@11.7.0"
}
